**Recommended Actions:**
1. Isolate host 10.1.21.58 immediately
2. Terminate all processes spawned by malware; force-kill any TeamViewer, update service, or unknown executables
3. Quarantine and scan all exported HTTP objects and running processes for known trojan signatures
4. Reset credentials for user gwyatt and all users who accessed systems from this workstation
5. Block IP 153.92.1.49 and domains whitepepper.su, media.megafilehub4.lat, communicationfirewall-security.cc, whooptm.cyou, holiday-forever.cc at firewall/DNS level
6. Audit Windows Event Logs on victim and DC for suspicious RPC, credential access, and lateral movement attempts
